  nodeId: Miller - Key Handoff
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<i>You drag the 'Restricted Corridor Door' onto the interrogation tab,
    preparing to press the witness on who has access to the back rooms.</i>\r\n\r\n<b>Detective
    Miller:</b> \r\n\"Don't bother with that right now. Here's the key for the corridor.
    Once we're done with the roster, you can investigate the Private Office.\"\r\n\r\n<b>ITEM
    REMOVED: The Restricted Corridor Door</b>\r\n<b>ITEM ACQUIRED: Restricted Master
    Key</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
